00:05:39.415 --> 00:05:40.498
But,

00:05:40.498 --> 00:05:42.310
now it really bothers me.

00:05:42.310 --> 00:05:43.483
Really bothers me.

00:05:43.483 --> 00:05:44.841
It's really hard to find a job.

00:05:44.841 --> 00:05:46.662
I have to constantly
keep covering it with,

00:05:46.662 --> 00:05:47.971
